          "rationale": "That was Augustus’ preferred title."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "label": "Imperator, a victorious general’s title",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "label": "Augustus, “the revered one”",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "That was a name the Senate gave."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Emperor comes from imperator, the title soldiers gave a victorious commander.",
